<title>UK: LME publishes July TAPOs settlements.</title>
<headline>LME publishes July TAPOs settlements.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The London Metal Exchange (LME) monthly average  settlement prices for copper and primary aluminium TAPOs for July  were as follows.</p>
<p>Copper Grade A - $2,450.46 a tonne</p>
<p>Primary Aluminium - $1,592.37 a tonne.</p>
<p>London Newroom, +44 171 542 7771</p>
</text>
